cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below."
title: "Temperature forecasting with CTGAN-based data augmentation and a temporal convolutional network"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the CTGAN data-augmentation workflow (one-class SVM
  outlier removal, standardisation, Yeo-Johnson transformation) combined with a
  temporal convolutional network for next-day maximum and minimum temperature
  forecasting, validated on the Seattle and Seoul weather datasets.
